reason=VPP cannot drive VMware vmxnet3 on this Workstation. Native-vmxnet3 and DPDK/uio-vmxnet3 both bind the virtual functions, but no usable VPP dataplane interface comes up; VPP-DPDK-INTERFACES/PING and the validator peer cycle cannot be produced.
