bounded_result=two kernel-vmxnet3 VMs; 64B ICMP 1000/1000 zero loss; after target hard reboot 1000/1000 zero loss
waiver_gate_flag=DANOS_RELEASE_ALLOW_VMWARE_OPEN=1 (with DANOS_RELEASE_ALLOW_OPEN_LANES=1 where an open PCI lane applies)
